            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# LighTxt 1.2

LighTxt 1.2 turns CSV View into a more capable large-file data workspace:

- Sort and filter individual columns without loading the entire CSV into memory.
- Inspect quick column summaries built from bounded, representative samples.
- Add or delete rows and columns with each operation preserved as a single Undo step.
- Benefit from reliability and performance improvements throughout sparse CSV indexing and editing.
]]></description>
